ion/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e45272e-8afe-5b6f-978b-ccf4afd87d68" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x<-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540327} {:answer/id #uuid "20878ee0-343d-5e0d-8708-37cd87317f70" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x\\in\\mathbb{R}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540330} {:answer/id #uuid "2adcd39f-66b4-5d95-89d7-09316483002a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x=-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540332} {:answer/id #uuid "b83ed8c1-dba8-5153-9161-a609f46b224c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x\\le -6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540373} {:answer/id #uuid "d83b4653-9428-53c9-a5f0-e0c582fa15fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "x>-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540379}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186540327} :answer-field/id #uuid "6864f1bb-68b1-5d61-8dc5-9e6625f3eed5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186540350}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "fb3e9e45-5ced-52f5-ba77-5853c61cad57" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=- 2 t - 2,\\,y=t,\\,t>2,\n$$\n\ndetermine the range of $x.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each variable in turn.\n\n- To find the range of $x,$ evaluate the endpoint: $x(2)=-6$. The coefficient of $t$ is $-2$, so the coordinate is monotone on the given half-line. The parameter endpoint is excluded. The range is $x<-6.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557627 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb9a309f-94bc-51a2-869f-3b3a9041caa5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "- \\frac{7}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557695}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557695} :answer-field/id #uuid "2358b114-00ed-5898-b286-205889192af5" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557636} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3fe8cfd3-e0cc-5393-a292-993c1116bc49" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "- \\frac{41}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557641}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557641} :answer-field/id #uuid "677c5a85-d33c-5340-9e9f-244d2e3567b2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557658} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ab59f56d-b3cc-5819-b89e-a111f64fab73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "- \\frac{94}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557675}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557675} :answer-field/id #uuid "94933d06-9871-5cc2-9edb-a456dd9744da" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557667}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "0ab26a74-291b-5410-83ed-7e43a17199d1" :question/problem "Consider the curve with parametric equations\n\n$$\nx=- \\frac{5 t^{2}}{4} - \\frac{4 t}{3} - 6,\\,y=- \\frac{3 t^{2}}{4} - \\frac{t}{3} + 6,\\,0\\le t\\le 5.\n$$\n\nFill in the blanks in the following table of values:\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-6$ | $- \\frac{103}{12}$ | {{field-1}} | $- \\frac{85}{4}$ | {{field-3}} | $- \\frac{527}{12}$ |\n| $y$ | $6$ | $\\frac{59}{12}$ | $\\frac{7}{3}$ | {{field-2}} | $- \\frac{22}{3}$ | $- \\frac{173}{12}$ |" :question/worked-solution "- To find the value of $x(2),$ we substitute $t=2$ into $$\n\\displaystyle x=- \\frac{5 t^{2}}{4} - \\frac{4 t}{3} - 6.\n$$ This gives\n\n$$\nx(2)=- \\frac{5 (2)^{2}}{4} - \\frac{4 (2)}{3} - 6=(-6)+(-5)+\\left(- \\frac{8}{3}\\right)=- \\frac{41}{3}.\n$$\n\n- To find the value of $y(3),$ we substitute $t=3$ into $$\n\\displaystyle y=- \\frac{3 t^{2}}{4} - \\frac{t}{3} + 6.\n$$ This gives\n\n$$\ny(3)=- \\frac{3 (3)^{2}}{4} - \\frac{(3)}{3} + 6=(6)+\\left(- \\frac{27}{4}\\right)+(-1)=- \\frac{7}{4}.\n$$\n\n- To find the value of $x(4),$ we substitute $t=4$ into $$\n\\displaystyle x=- \\frac{5 t^{2}}{4} - \\frac{4 t}{3} - 6.\n$$ This gives\n\n$$\nx(4)=- \\frac{5 (4)^{2}}{4} - \\frac{4 (4)}{3} - 6=(-6)+(-20)+\\left(- \\frac{16}{3}\\right)=- \\frac{94}{3}.\n$$\n\nThen the table is\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-6$ | $- \\frac{103}{12}$ | $- \\frac{41}{3}$ | $- \\frac{85}{4}$ | $- \\frac{94}{3}$ | $- \\frac{527}{12}$ |\n| $y$ | $6$ | $\\frac{59}{12}$ | $\\frac{7}{3}$ | $- \\frac{7}{4}$ | $- \\frac{22}{3}$ | $- \\frac{173}{12}$ |"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557631 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9bd1951c-0602-55a5-8645-0789fe856a88" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{25}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557671}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557671} :answer-field/id #uuid "55ebcdaa-54ae-5f9c-bb83-2fab47dcd1f6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557651} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "591b377a-f05f-55a2-80e5-1390a0863f4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{56}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557654}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557654} :answer-field/id #uuid "656eda5e-1958-5e69-9543-aece5e8c6dcf" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557656} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08441e59-4936-522c-94dc-e808225422f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557626}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557626} :answer-field/id #uuid "66fd5de2-d0f1-5abd-9945-24b9ffb7f3b3" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218604